    "profilePrintedName": "C.Mohamed Nassar",
    "title": "Chairman / MD",
    "sourcePage": 10,
    "messageParagraphs": [
      "For over four decades, Al-Karrim Lanka has proudly served as a bridge between opportunity and talent - connecting global employers with Sri Lanka's skilled, hardworking, and adaptable workforce. Our engineers, technicians, and tradespeople are respected worldwide for their professionalism, resilience, and ability to thrive in multicultural environments.",
      "We believe in the power of strategic partnerships. By aligning with organizations that value quality manpower, we help drive productivity while uplifting the prospects of Sri Lankan workers. Many of our candidates bring overseas experience with multinational firms, yet remain competitively positioned - ready to contribute from day one.",
      "As Chairman, I see a bright and promising future in this mission. Our commitment to confidentiality, operational excellence, and client satisfaction remains unwavering. We invite you to experience the Al-Karrim Lanka difference - where integrity meets impact, and recruitment becomes a catalyst for mutual growth."
